s/location.svg); -webkit-mask-image: url('/static/icons/location.svg'); \"></div></div>\n<div class=\"metadata-text\">Eneco - Rotterdam</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"success-factors discipline\" tabindex=\"100\"><div class=\"metadata-icon\"><div class=\"bg-color-2 icon\" style=\"mask-image:url(/static/icons/discipline.svg); -webkit-mask-image: url('/static/icons/discipline.svg'); \"></div></div>\n<div class=\"metadata-text\">Energy Trading</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"success-factors experience\" tabindex=\"101\"><div class=\"metadata-icon\"><div class=\"bg-color-2 icon\" style=\"mask-image:url(/static/icons/experience.svg); -webkit-mask-image: url('/static/icons/experience.svg'); \"></div></div>\n<div class=\"metadata-text\">3-5 jaar</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"success-factors salary\" tabindex=\"102\"><div class=\"metadata-icon\"><div class=\"bg-color-2 icon\" style=\"mask-image:url(/static/icons/education.svg); -webkit-mask-image: url('/static/icons/education.svg'); \"></div></div>\n<div class=\"metadata-text\">€110.000 - €170.000</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"success-factors hours\" tabindex=\"103\"><div class=\"metadata-icon\"><div class=\"bg-color-2 icon\" style=\"mask-image:url(/static/icons/clock.svg); -webkit-mask-image: url('/static/icons/clock.svg'); \"></div></div>\n<div class=\"metadata-text\">40 uur</div>\n</li>\n</div></ul></div><div class=\"btn-container\"><div class=\"btn btn-submit bg-color-1 color-white\" onClick=\"stickyScrollOpenForm('hident2')\"><span class=\"btn-label\">Apply</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter hide-on-mobile hide-on-tablet under-row\" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"104\"><i>Good to know: you can easily save this vacancy using the print button at the top of the page. After the closing date, this vacancy will be removed from our website.</i></div><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-custom\" style=\"height: 60px; min-height: 60px;\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-2 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"vacancy-appetizer intro text-align-left \" tabindex=\"105\"></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-2 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"text vacancy-description text-align-left \"><div class=\"description\" tabindex=\"107\"><ul><li><p>A pure proprietary gas trading role with real risk capital and clear P&L accountability</p></li><li><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Opportunity to trade European gas with exposure to JKM (Asia) and Henry Hub (US)</span></p></li><li><p><span data-teams=\"true\">Direct impact on Eneco’s trading performance in a fast‑moving market environment</span></p></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-xl\" style=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"108\">Why choose Eneco?</h2><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"text vacancy-description text-align-left \"><div class=\"description\" tabindex=\"110\"><div><p>At Eneco, proprietary trading plays a meaningful role in accelerating the energy transition. You’ll be part of a commercially sharp and well‑governed trading environment where market expertise is used to support a sustainable energy system — today and in the future.<br><br>You join an organisation where responsibility and ownership are central. Decisions are data‑driven, market‑focused and taken close to the action, giving you the autonomy to act while operating within a clear risk framework.<br><br>You’ll work closely with experienced traders, analysts and risk professionals who challenge each other and raise the bar together. Strong performance is recognised and rewarded, with clear accountability for outcomes.<br><br>Most importantly, Eneco offers the space to bring ideas, take calculated risks and make a real impact — both on trading performance and on the broader energy transition.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-2 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion-group accordion-group\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion accordion component\"><div class=\"accordion-title\" onclick=\"(() => event.target.parentNode.classList.toggle('open'))()\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"111\">What you’ll do</h2></div><div class=\"accordion-content\" tabIndex=\"112\"><div><p>You identify, develop and execute proprietary trading opportunities across global gas markets, with a clear focus on Asian LNG (JKM) and North American natural gas (Henry Hub). Using a deep understanding of fundamentals, market dynamics and cross-market linkages, you translate insights into actionable trades that generate consistent P&L.<br><br>As a Senior Gas Trader, you design, implement and manage end‑to‑end trading strategies. You take meaningful positions with confidence, actively manage risk and handle drawdowns with discipline and professionalism. Your decisions balance commercial ambition with robust risk management.<br><br>You operate independently while remaining closely aligned with the broader trading desk. By sharing insights, challenging views and contributing to desk-wide objectives, you help strengthen the overall performance and strategic ambitions of the proprietary trading team.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion-group accordion-group\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion accordion component\"><div class=\"accordion-title\" onclick=\"(() => event.target.parentNode.classList.toggle('open'))()\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"113\">Is this about you?</h2></div><div class=\"accordion-content\" tabIndex=\"114\"><p><span>You are a confident, driven trader who is comfortable taking responsibility and making decisions under pressure. You bring ideas, act on them, and understand that performance comes from disciplined execution. </span><span>You have:</span></p><ul><li><span>Around 5–10 years of trading experience, with at least 3 years in a proprietary trading environment;</span></li><li><span>Recent and relevant prop trading experience (not historical);</span></li><li><span>A quantitative or economics‑based academic background;</span></li><li><span>Experience managing meaningful positions and drawdowns;</span></li><li><span>Proven ability to operate with real risk capital and deliver consistent results;</span></li><li><span>Strong understanding of gas market fundamentals;</span></li><li><span>Strong understanding of JKM and HH pricing dynamics and LNG contract structures;</span></li><li><span>The confidence to challenge, convince and collaborate within a senior team;</span></li><li><span>A mindset focused on performance, ownership and long‑term contribution.</span></li></ul><p> </p><p><span>Nice to have:</span></p><ul><li><span>Experience trading cross-commodity spreads;</span></li><li><span>Knowledge of LNG shipping economics and chartering;</span></li><li><span>Experience at recognised trading organisations (e.g. utilities, trading houses, banks, funds).</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-2 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion-group accordion-group\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion accordion component\"><div class=\"accordion-title\" onclick=\"(() => event.target.parentNode.classList.toggle('open'))()\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"115\">You’ll be responsible for</h2></div><div class=\"accordion-content\" tabIndex=\"116\"><ul><li><span>Developing and executing proprietary gas trading strategies across short‑ and longer‑term horizons;</span></li><li><span>Actively trading European gas markets, with exposure to JKM and Henry Hub;</span></li><li><span>Managing risk positions within defined Value at Risk (VaR) limits;</span></li><li><span>Taking ownership of P&L performance and contributing to desk‑level results;</span></li><li><span>Translating market fundamentals (supply, demand, flows, geopolitics) into actionable trades;</span></li><li><span>Working closely with analysts to validate ideas and strengthen conviction;</span></li><li><span>Sharing insights and trade ideas with other traders to strengthen overall performance;</span></li><li><span>Continuously improving execution, timing and risk utilisation.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion-group accordion-group\"><div class=\"vacancy-accordion accordion component\"><div class=\"accordion-title\" onclick=\"(() => event.target.parentNode.classList.toggle('open'))()\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"117\">This is where you’ll work</h2></div><div class=\"accordion-content\" tabIndex=\"118\"><div><p>You’ll join Eneco’s proprietary trading team: a small, highly experienced group of traders based in the Netherlands. Given the speed of the market and the collaborative way the desk operates, physical presence in the office is essential to how the team works and performs.<br><br>The team brings together fundamental trading expertise, proprietary risk‑taking and strong analyst support with quantitative insights. This combination allows you to move quickly, challenge perspectives and turn market signals into robust trading decisions.<br><br>Together, you work towards ambitious growth targets in a professional, performance‑driven environment where accountability, collaboration and commercial sharpness go hand in hand.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"119\">What we have to offer</h2><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-4 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-3  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-width full-height\"><div class=\"usp  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"usp-aside\"><div class=\"image\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><picture><img src=\"/static/uploads/16373-icoon-bruto-jaarsalaris.png\" title=\"title\" alt=\"alt\" aria-label=\"\"></picture></div></div></div><div class=\"usp-body\"><h3 class=\"heading heading-three text-align-left \" tabindex=\"120\">Gross annual salary between €110.000 and €170.000</h3><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"121\">Including FlexBudget, 8% holiday allowance, and depending on your role a bonus or collective profit sharing.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-3  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-width full-height\"><div class=\"usp  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"usp-aside\"><div class=\"image\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><picture><img src=\"/static/uploads/16372-icoon-flex-budget.png\" title=\"title\" alt=\"alt\" aria-label=\"\"></picture></div></div></div><div class=\"usp-body\"><h3 class=\"heading heading-three text-align-left \" tabindex=\"122\">FlexBudget</h3><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"123\">Have it paid out, use it to buy extra holiday days or save it up for something nice, it's up to you.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-3  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-width full-height\"><div class=\"usp  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"usp-aside\"><div class=\"image\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><picture><img src=\"/static/uploads/16371-icoon-persoonlijke-ontwikkeling-gradient.png\" title=\"title\" alt=\"alt\" aria-label=\"\"></picture></div></div></div><div class=\"usp-body\"><h3 class=\"heading heading-three text-align-left \" tabindex=\"124\">Personal and professional growth</h3><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"125\">Eneco is fully committed to help you in your personal and professional development.</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-3  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-width full-height\"><div class=\"usp  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"usp-aside\"><div class=\"image\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><picture><img src=\"/static/uploads/16370-icoon-hybride-werken.png\" title=\"title\" alt=\"alt\" aria-label=\"\"></picture></div></div></div><div class=\"usp-body\"><h3 class=\"heading heading-three text-align-left \" tabindex=\"126\">Hybrid working: home, office or abroad</h3><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"127\">Work 40% at the office, 40% from home, and 20% flexibly. With manager approval, you may work abroad (within approved countries) up to 3 weeks/year, max 2 consecutively.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><h3 class=\"heading heading-three text-align-center \" tabindex=\"128\">Want more information about our terms of employment?</h3><div class=\"text text-align-center \" tabindex=\"129\"><a href=\"https://www.jobsateneco.com/what-you-get-from-us\"><b>Here's what you get from us</b></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-custom\" style=\"height: 60px; min-height: 60px;\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-2 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-fill full-width full-height\"><div class=\"image image-vertical-align-fill image-horizontal-align-fill\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/static/uploads/16074-3541-ev-d0005212-1180x785.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"Werken bij Eneco is voor iedereen\" aria-label=\"\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col col-md-6  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"130\">Work Where Everyone Matters </h2><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"131\">When you choose a career at Eneco, you choose ambition, growth, and opportunity in an environment where everyone matters. You’re given the space to develop yourself and to do your work in a way that suits you. We believe that different perspectives, nationalities, and backgrounds make us stronger, which is why we foster an open, safe and inclusive culture. Naturally, we also prioritize a healthy work-life balance, flexible working hours, and the option to work from home when your role allows it. If you have a physical or sensory disability, we will work with you to find the right adjustments so you can perform your job well. </div><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"132\">This is how you build your own future and a sustainable future at the same time. Together with 4,000 colleagues, each with their own talents and ideas, you work on our shared mission: speeding up the energy transition. We help customers become more sustainable faster, create innovative solutions, and seize new opportunities. Will you join us?</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-xl\" style=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-height\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"133\">The phases of our application procedure</h2><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-sm\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"image image-vertical-align-fill image-horizontal-align-fill\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/static/uploads/16391-eneco-werkenbijeneco-visual-02-eng.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"Application procedure, 1 applying, 2 introduction interview, 3 online assessment, 4 follo-up interview, 5 offer time and 6 congratulations with your new job\" aria-label=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"134\">Want to know more about this job function?</h2><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"text vacancy-description text-align-left \"><div class=\"description\" tabindex=\"136\"><div><p>Would you like to know more about this vacancy?<br>Ahmed Hammoudan, our Head of Trading, will be happy to answer your questions via <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"c9a8a1a4acade7a1a8a4a4a6bcada8a789aca7acaaa6e7aaa6a4\">[email&#160;protected]</a>.</p><p>For more information about the application process, you can contact our recruiter Kevin Wouters via +31000000000 or <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"0d66687b6463237a627879687f7e4d6863686e62236e6260\">[email&#160;protected]</a>.</p><p><strong>Agency notice:</strong><br>We fill our vacancies through direct recruitment. Therefore, unsolicited acquisition based on this vacancy is not appreciated.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"contact-person recruiter\"><div class=\"image image-vertical-align-fill image-horizontal-align-fill\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/static/uploads/16612-im-g-3375-bewerkt-bewerkt.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"contact-person-body\"><div class=\"contact-content\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"137\">Questions about the application procedure</h2><div class=\"text text-align-left \" tabindex=\"138\">Feel free to contact our recruiter:</div><h3 tabindex=\"139\"><span class=\"first-name\">Kevin</span><span class=\"last-name\"> Wouters</span></h3><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\"></div><a class=\"phoneNumber link\" href=\"tel:+31000000000\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"141\"><div class=\"link-icon\"></div>+31000000000</a><a class=\"email link\" href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#8fc4cad9c6c1a1d8c0dadbcadddccfcac1caccc0a1ccc0c2\" target=\"_blank\" tabindex=\"143\"><div class=\"link-icon\"></div>Stuur een e-mail</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"job-alert\"><div class=\"job-alert-wrapper\"><div class=\"image\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><div class=\"image image-vertical-align-top image-horizontal-align-fill\"><div class=\"image-wrapper\"><img src=\"/static/uploads/16360-01-enec-o-popstudi-o-25-mr-t22-257-2025-copy.jpg\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"search-block-content\"><div class=\"search-block\"><div class=\"search-block-text\"><h2 class=\"heading heading-two text-align-left \" tabindex=\"144\">Would you like to receive our newest job vacancies?  </h2></div><form class=\"job-alert-content job-alert-form\" action=\"/api/1/job-alert-redirect\" method=\"POST\"><div class=\"form-field\"><input class=\"form-input\" type=\"text\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"E-mailadres\" value=\"\" tabindex=\"146\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_token\" tabindex=\"-1\"></div><div class=\"button-submit\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline border-color-2 color-2\" tabindex=\"147\"><span>Activate Job Alert</span></button></div></form></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-md\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-top full-height\"><div class=\"intro text-align-center\" tabindex=\"148\"><div class=\"text \">With this job opening, we want to recruit a new Eneco colleague ourselves. This is not a call for acquisition.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"row hide-in-css   no-margin layout-1 row-gutter \" style=\" \"><div class=\"row-wrapper\"><div class=\"col col-md-12  \" style=\"\"><div class=\"group group-vertical-align-center full-height\"><div class=\"spacer spacer-size-lg\" style=\"\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"baseSalary\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"value\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"maxValue\":170000,\"minValue\":110000,\"unitText\":\"MONTH\"}},\"datePosted\":\"2026-04-12T22:03:48.654743Z\",\"description\":\"<div><p>At Eneco, proprietary trading plays a meaningful role in accelerating the energy transition. You’ll be part of a commercially sharp and well‑governed trading environment where market expertise is used to support a sustainable energy system — today and in the future.<br><br>You join an organisation where responsibility and ownership are central. Decisions are data‑driven, market‑focused and taken close to the action, giving you the autonomy to act while operating within a clear risk framework.<br><br>You’ll work closely with experienced traders, analysts and risk professionals who challenge each other and raise the bar together. Strong performance is recognised and rewarded, with clear accountability for outcomes.<br><br>Most importantly, Eneco offers the space to bring ideas, take calculated risks and make a real impact — both on trading performance and on the broader energy transition.</p></div><div><p>You identify, develop and execute proprietary trading opportunities across global gas markets, with a clear focus on Asian LNG (JKM) and North American natural gas (Henry Hub). Using a deep understanding of fundamentals, market dynamics and cross-market linkages, you translate insights into actionable trades that generate consistent P&L.<br><br>As a Senior Gas Trader, you design, implement and manage end‑to‑end trading strategies. You take meaningful positions with confidence, actively manage risk and handle drawdowns with discipline and professionalism. Your decisions balance commercial ambition with robust risk management.<br><br>You operate independently while remaining closely aligned with the broader trading desk. By sharing insights, challenging views and contributing to desk-wide objectives, you help strengthen the overall performance and strategic ambitions of the proprietary trading team.</p></div><ul><li><span>Developing and executing proprietary gas trading strategies across short‑ and longer‑term horizons;</span></li><li><span>Actively trading European gas markets, with exposure to JKM and Henry Hub;</span></li><li><span>Managing risk positions within defined Value at Risk (VaR) limits;</span></li><li><span>Taking ownership of P&L performance and contributing to desk‑level results;</span></li><li><span>Translating market fundamentals (supply, demand, flows, geopolitics) into actionable trades;</span></li><li><span>Working closely with analysts to validate ideas and strengthen conviction;</span></li><li><span>Sharing insights and trade ideas with other traders to strengthen overall performance;</span></li><li><span>Continuously improving execution, timing and risk utilisation.</span></li></ul><p><span>You are a confident, driven trader who is comfortable taking responsibility and making decisions under pressure. You bring ideas, act on them, and understand that performance comes from disciplined execution. </span><span>You have:</span></p><ul><li><span>Around 5–10 years of trading experience, with at least 3 years in a proprietary trading environment;</span></li><li><span>Recent and relevant prop trading experience (not historical);</span></li><li><span>A quantitative or economics‑based academic background;</span></li><li><span>Experience managing meaningful positions and drawdowns;</span></li><li><span>Proven ability to operate with real risk capital and deliver consistent results;</span></li><li><span>Strong understanding of gas market fundamentals;</span></li><li><span>Strong understanding of JKM and HH pricing dynamics and LNG contract structures;</span></li><li><span>The confidence to challenge, convince and collaborate within a senior team;</span></li><li><span>A mindset focused on performance, ownership and long‑term contribution.</span></li></ul><p> </p><p><span>Nice to have:</span></p><ul><li><span>Experience trading cross-commodity spreads;</span></li><li><span>Knowledge of LNG shipping economics and chartering;</span></li><li><span>Experience at recognised trading organisations (e.g. utilities, trading houses, banks, funds).</span></li></ul><div><p>You’ll join Eneco’s proprietary trading team: a small, highly experienced group of traders based in the Netherlands. Given the speed of the market and the collaborative way the desk operates, physical presence in the office is essential to how the team works and performs.<br><br>The team brings together fundamental trading expertise, proprietary risk‑taking and strong analyst support with quantitative insights. This combination allows you to move quickly, challenge perspectives and turn market signals into robust trading decisions.<br><br>Together, you work towards ambitious growth targets in a professional, performance‑driven environment where accountability, collaboration and commercial sharpness go hand in hand.</p></div><div><p>Would you like to know more about this vacancy?<br>Ahmed Hammoudan, our Head of Trading, will be happy to answer your questions via redacted@example.invalid.</p><p>For more information about the application process, you can contact our recruiter Kevin Wouters via +31000000000 or redacted@example.invalid.</p><p><strong>Agency notice:</strong><br>We fill our vacancies through direct recruitment. Therefore, unsolicited acquisition based on this vacancy is not appreciated.</p></div><ul><li><p>A pure proprietary gas trading role with real risk capital and clear P&L accountability</p></li><li><p><span data-teams=\\\"true\\\">Opportunity to trade European gas with exposure to JKM (Asia) and Henry Hub (US)</span></p></li><li><p><span data-teams=\\\"true\\\">Direct impact on Eneco’s trading performance in a fast‑moving market environment</span></p></li></ul>\",\"educationRequirements\":[\"Master WO\"],\"employmentType\":[],\"experienceRequirements\":[\"3-5 jaar\"],\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"address\":null,\"logo\":\"https://www.werkenbijeneco.nl/static/images/icon-32x32.png\",\"name\":\"Eneco\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/werkenbijeneco/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/eneco/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/eneco\",\"https://www.instagram.com/werkenbijeneco/\"],\"url\":\"/\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressCountry\":\"Netherlands\",\"addressLocality\":\"Rotterdam\",\"addressRegion\":\"\",\"postalCode\":\"3068 AV\",\"streetAddress\":\"Marten Meesweg\"}},\"title\":\"Senior Trader Gas\",\"validThrough\":null,\"workHours\":\"40 uur\"}</script></script><div class=\"cookie-modal tafkar-modal bg-color-3\" data-tab-scope><div class=\"cookie-body\"><div class=\"cookie-info\"><h2 class=\"title\" tab